{"2302120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Infinitum: The Backrooms Story", "steam_appid": 2302120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/23efa1aed2cdc48bce53cdda321a11b7.avif?t=1787306406\" width=1232 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/8ae3c4413dbab79e7f5564a87b030233.avif?t=1787306406\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras_big/8ae3c4413dbab79e7f5564a87b030233.webp?t=1787306406 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated Backrooms levels mixed with handcrafted areas. Each expedition can lead to different corridors, offices, hostile zones, safe rooms, and decayed spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some parts are built by hand for story moments, puzzles, scripted events, and chase sequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Backrooms are not always loud or dangerous. Sometimes the worst part is finding a room that feels safe, but shouldn’t be there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/166ce122ac94246d60728e9624912f5f.avif?t=1787306406\" width=1232 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/5ca9b289883d494a2878dec724986332.avif?t=1787306406\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras_big/5ca9b289883d494a2878dec724986332.webp?t=1787306406 width=1560 height=719 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-tech survival inside forgotten Backrooms spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wear neon-lit hazmat suits, use tools like the MEC container, holographic tablet, and scanners, and move through decayed levels where advanced gear feels strangely out of place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your suit with colours, decals, and patterns so your team stands out in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/bba43c288ca79a073a39f6b38c7e58ee.avif?t=1787306406\" width=1232 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/292009658770bfd659b2a278e7b38119.avif?t=1787306406\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras_big/292009658770bfd659b2a278e7b38119.webp?t=1787306406 width=1560 height=719 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your base inside the Backrooms, where the Crew rests, works, and prepares for the next expedition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring back objects from the levels, recycle them into resources, craft tools, and unlock new recipes through exploration and Outpost tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Outpost is not just a menu. The Crew has routines, responsibilities, and stories, and keeping yourself rested can affect how well you survive outside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/bd0add9e6a8ae496f155e1f763749f9c.avif?t=1787306406\" width=1232 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/e321994cfb3bbe8b71c5f91b035a2bd9.avif?t=1787306406\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras_big/e321994cfb3bbe8b71c5f91b035a2bd9.webp?t=1787306406 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Backrooms with friends, but stay close. With proximity chat, distance can turn teamwork into silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge, heal, survive, and bring resources back to the Outpost together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between the horror, customize your suit, use emotes, mess with friends, adopt cats, and create your own co-op moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/c46de725d1d24bf948778754137dd076.avif?t=1787306406\" width=1232 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/c55acc3fb89a266260a0fad0ce72a63b.avif?t=1787306406\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras_big/c55acc3fb89a266260a0fad0ce72a63b.webp?t=1787306406 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition tests more than your courage. Hunger, thirst, stamina, and limited light all affect how far you can push into the Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage food, water, batteries, and tools carefully. Running out of supplies can make escape much harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you bring back matters too. Scavenged resources can support both your survival and the Outpost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/d6410cb245ae4d79b4cd43b6392152c3.avif?t=1787306406\" width=1232 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/dccdd3ec975a4879a7cdd445ed7379e1.avif?t=1787306406\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras_big/dccdd3ec975a4879a7cdd445ed7379e1.webp?t=1787306406 width=1560 height=719 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinitum follows Izaak Finnley’s story, with dialogue, choices, and consequences that affect how events unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In multiplayer, everyone experiences the story from Izaak’s perspective. When major decisions appear, players vote, and the majority choice decides the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who you support, what you sacrifice, and how you treat the Crew can change the story, resources, dialogue, and who survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/3029cd754b4801712573b86903e26fbc.avif?t=1787306406\" width=1232 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/10ea06252984cd120d141bda8e3aef70.avif?t=1787306406\" width=1498 height=772 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every entity behaves the same. Some hunt, some watch, and some only react under specific conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how each encounter works, adapt during expeditions, and stay alert when the Backrooms feel too quiet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scripted chase sequences create intense moments, while procedural encounters keep exploration unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/23efa1aed2cdc48bce53cdda321a11b7.avif?t=1787306406\" width=1232 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/8ae3c4413dbab79e7f5564a87b030233.avif?t=1787306406\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras_big/8ae3c4413dbab79e7f5564a87b030233.webp?t=1787306406 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated Backrooms levels mixed with handcrafted areas. Each expedition can lead to different corridors, offices, hostile zones, safe rooms, and decayed spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some parts are built by hand for story moments, puzzles, scripted events, and chase sequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Backrooms are not always loud or dangerous. Sometimes the worst part is finding a room that feels safe, but shouldn’t be there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/166ce122ac94246d60728e9624912f5f.avif?t=1787306406\" width=1232 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/5ca9b289883d494a2878dec724986332.avif?t=1787306406\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras_big/5ca9b289883d494a2878dec724986332.webp?t=1787306406 width=1560 height=719 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-tech survival inside forgotten Backrooms spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wear neon-lit hazmat suits, use tools like the MEC container, holographic tablet, and scanners, and move through decayed levels where advanced gear feels strangely out of place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your suit with colours, decals, and patterns so your team stands out in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/bba43c288ca79a073a39f6b38c7e58ee.avif?t=1787306406\" width=1232 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/292009658770bfd659b2a278e7b38119.avif?t=1787306406\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras_big/292009658770bfd659b2a278e7b38119.webp?t=1787306406 width=1560 height=719 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your base inside the Backrooms, where the Crew rests, works, and prepares for the next expedition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring back objects from the levels, recycle them into resources, craft tools, and unlock new recipes through exploration and Outpost tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Outpost is not just a menu. The Crew has routines, responsibilities, and stories, and keeping yourself rested can affect how well you survive outside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/bd0add9e6a8ae496f155e1f763749f9c.avif?t=1787306406\" width=1232 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/e321994cfb3bbe8b71c5f91b035a2bd9.avif?t=1787306406\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras_big/e321994cfb3bbe8b71c5f91b035a2bd9.webp?t=1787306406 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Backrooms with friends, but stay close. With proximity chat, distance can turn teamwork into silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge, heal, survive, and bring resources back to the Outpost together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between the horror, customize your suit, use emotes, mess with friends, adopt cats, and create your own co-op moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/c46de725d1d24bf948778754137dd076.avif?t=1787306406\" width=1232 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/c55acc3fb89a266260a0fad0ce72a63b.avif?t=1787306406\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras_big/c55acc3fb89a266260a0fad0ce72a63b.webp?t=1787306406 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition tests more than your courage. Hunger, thirst, stamina, and limited light all affect how far you can push into the Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage food, water, batteries, and tools carefully. Running out of supplies can make escape much harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you bring back matters too. Scavenged resources can support both your survival and the Outpost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/d6410cb245ae4d79b4cd43b6392152c3.avif?t=1787306406\" width=1232 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/dccdd3ec975a4879a7cdd445ed7379e1.avif?t=1787306406\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras_big/dccdd3ec975a4879a7cdd445ed7379e1.webp?t=1787306406 width=1560 height=719 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinitum follows Izaak Finnley’s story, with dialogue, choices, and consequences that affect how events unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In multiplayer, everyone experiences the story from Izaak’s perspective. When major decisions appear, players vote, and the majority choice decides the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who you support, what you sacrifice, and how you treat the Crew can change the story, resources, dialogue, and who survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/3029cd754b4801712573b86903e26fbc.avif?t=1787306406\" width=1232 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302120/extras/10ea06252984cd120d141bda8e3aef70.avif?t=1787306406\" width=1498 height=772 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every entity behaves the same. Some hunt, some watch, and some only react under specific conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how each encounter works, adapt during expeditions, and stay alert when the Backrooms feel too quiet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scripted chase sequences create intense moments, while procedural encounters keep exploration unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "INFINITUM is a horror open-world survival co-op story game for up to 4 players. Explore endless procedurally generated levels and uncover multiple endings, with every playthrough offering a unique experience.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainia